C. Interpretation
  The old transparency slogan is only safe after relocation.
  The coprime/nonresonant optimum is usually t=1/2; resonant/even speeds die there.
  The useful variable is u=2t: evens descend to E, odds become two branch filters.
  Branch 1 is the off-grid lift: it keeps odds near half-integers while E supplies safety.
  Proof target: show E_safe intersects at least one odd branch for every covering S.
  If every hard row needs an even branch label, HYP-3418's 2-adic floor story is the right spine.

